@startuml Voting and Award Assignment

skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #E8E8E8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #888888
skinparam ActivityFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #E8E8E8
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #888888
skinparam PartitionBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam PartitionBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam NoteBorderColor #AAAAAA

title Voting and Award Assignment

|User|
start
:Browse contest paintings;

|System|
:Return paintings\n(exclude award winners);

note right
  Paintings that already won
  an award (1st, 2nd, 3rd)
  are excluded from voting.
end note

|User|
:Select painting to vote for;

|System|
:Validate user is logged in;
:Check user has not\nalready voted for\nthis painting in this round;

if (Already voted?) then ([Yes])
  |User|
  :Error: Already voted;
  detach
else ([No])
  :Create Vote entity;
  :Increment painting\nvote count;

  |User|
  :Vote recorded successfully;
endif

|System|
:Calculate final rankings\nbased on examiner scores;
:Identify award winners\nby finalScore\n(based on each award's quantity);
:Identify audience\nfavorite by vote count;

|Staff|
:View contest results:\n- Award winners (1st, 2nd, 3rd)\n- Audience favorite winner;

:Assign awards to winners;

|System|
while (More winners?) is ([Yes])
  :Link award to\nwinning competitor;
  :Create award notification;
endwhile ([No])

|Staff|
:Create announcement post;

|System|
:Create Post entity\n(status: DRAFT);

|Staff|
:Publish post;

|System|
:Update post status\nto PUBLISHED;

|User|
:Receive email notification;
:Receive push notification;

|Staff|
:Create exhibition;

|System|
:Create Exhibition entity;

|Staff|
:Add winning paintings\nto exhibition;

|System|
while (More paintings?) is ([Yes])
  :Link painting\nto exhibition;
endwhile ([No])

|Staff|
:Create 3D space\nfor exhibition;

|System|
:Create 3D Space entity\nlinked to exhibition;

:Exhibition ready for\npublic viewing;

|User|
:Browse exhibitions;
:View winning artworks;

stop

@enduml
